Z||000002||RossT||12-15-2000||11:22 PM||||Only two others on the forum from ND.  Myself<BR>in Bismarck, and v8fiero (aka Scott) in Minot.  Why would you be moving to Grand Forks?? Air Force Base?  Prepare yourself for "REAL" winters with lots of "wind".  If you can handle 4 extreme seasons, then you will like it here.  Most that move here from out of state, normally leave within a year or two.  But many, stay and love the great quality of life.  Little crime, great schools, great people etc...  Many people don't lock their cars and leave the keys in the ignition!! <P>Anway, there are some fiero people here, just not alot. Fieros in the junk yards are normally left alone!!!||||reg||1
